# Niva — Hebrew RTL landing page

## Layout

- Always set `lang="he"` and `dir="rtl"` on `<html>`.
- Use **logical** spacing (padding-inline, margin-inline) — avoid hard-coded `left`/`right` unless intentional (e.g. phone FAB on visual left).
- Text alignment: default RTL; center only for section titles and dark-banner intro.
- Mobile-first breakpoints; test at 375px width.

## Design tokens (from docs/design/DESIGN.md)

| Token | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Primary red | `#D32F2F` |
| Dark section | `#1A1A1A` |
| Body text | `#444444` |
| Font | Heebo (Google Fonts) |

Do not invent new colors without user approval.

## Content

- Brand: **איפור תרפי · Makeup Therapy**
- Owner name placeholder: `[שם בעלת העמוד]` — replace only when user provides real name.
- Copy source of truth: `docs/design/content-map.md`
- Do not rewrite Hebrew marketing copy unless user asks.

## Stack constraints

- **Static HTML/CSS** for v1 — no Next.js/React unless user explicitly requests migration.
- No new npm dependencies for a single landing page.
- Form: Formspree or Netlify Forms — never invent a custom backend without approval.

## Sections (in order)

1. Header — logo, nav, phone FAB
2. Hero `#about`
3. Dark banner — method / audience
4. Workshops `#workshops` — 3 cards
5. Contact `#contact` — name, phone, workshop select
6. Footer

## Before marking done

- [ ] RTL renders correctly
- [ ] Phone link uses real number when provided
- [ ] Workshop CTAs link to `#contact`
- [ ] No lorem ipsum or English placeholder text in user-facing copy
